  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAIR4ALL Agric and Mining Value Chains in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a continuation of GHAB22 and the project seeks to train and sensitise relevant stakeholders on the laws and policies on citizen&apos;s rights in the extractives and agriculture value chains; undertake research as relates to sustainable business value chains; produce and disseminate educational materials on policies and laws on corporate social responsibility; facilitate multi -stakeholder dialogues and alliances etc. It will also formulate policy proposals and advocate for the domestication of international norms and standards on rights protection and anti -corruption in the fiscal space and sustainable business chains in the cocoa and extractives sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
